@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Conditional retry and backoff timeline
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

participant "Coordinator" as C
participant "Eligible dependency operation" as D
C -> D : attempt A1
D --> C : confirmed no-effect / repetition-safe result
... delay d1 selected by actual policy ...
C -> C : recheck deadline, authority, budget and identity semantics
C -> D : attempt A2 only if still eligible
D --> C : safe repeat outcome or actual completion
... delay d2, optional jitter under selected policy ...
C -> C : stop if deadline/budget exhausted
note over C,D
 d1 / d2 are symbolic, not seconds or an accepted retry count.
 Unknown consequential effects exit to same-attempt reconciliation.
 No layered automatic retry amplification is authorized.
end note

@enduml
